#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[!meta title=\"Shutting down Tails\"]]\n"
msgstr "[[!meta title=\"Tails herunterfahren\"]]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "There are several ways of shutting down Tails:"
msgid "There are 2 ways of shutting down Tails."
msgstr "Es gibt mehrere Möglichkeiten, Tails herunterzufahren:"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[!toc startlevel=2]]\n"
msgstr "[[!toc startlevel=2]]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "When you shut down Tails, all the data stored in [[!wikipedia\n"
#| "Random-access_memory desc=\"RAM\"]] is erased\n"
#| "to protect you from [[cold boot\n"
#| "attacks|doc/advanced_topics/cold_boot_attacks]].\n"
msgid ""
"With both techniques, all the data stored in [[!wikipedia Random-access_memory\n"
"desc=\"RAM\"]] is securely erased to protect you from [[cold boot\n"
"attacks|doc/advanced_topics/cold_boot_attacks]].\n"
msgstr ""
"Während des Herunterfahrens werden sämtliche Daten, welche im [[!wikipedia_de \n"
"Random-Access_Memory desc=\"RAM\"]] gespeichert sind, gelöscht, um Sie vor\n"
"[[Cold_Boot_Attacks|doc/advanced_topics/cold_boot_attacks]] zu schützen.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<h2 id=\"standard\">Standard shutdown from the system menu</h2>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
msgid ""
"The standard shutdown procedure is slower, but prevents damage to your "
"Persistent Storage and data loss."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "By clicking on the system menu located in the upper right corner of the "
#| "screen and choosing either:"
msgid "Open the system menu in the upper-right corner of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Indem Sie das Systemmenü, welches in der oberen rechten Ecke des Bildschirm "
"ist, anklicken und Sie entweder:"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   [[!img desktop/system-with-wifi-only.png class=\"screenshot\" alt=\"\"]]\n"
msgstr "   [[!img desktop/system-with-wifi-only.png class=\"screenshot\" alt=\"\"]]\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "[[!img lib/system-shutdown.png link=\"no\" class=\"symbolic\" "
#| "alt=\"Shutdown icon\"]] to shutdown the computer or"
msgid ""
"Select [[!img lib/system-shutdown.png link=\"no\" class=\"symbolic\" "
"alt=\"Power Off\"]]."
msgstr ""
"[[!img lib/system-shutdown.png link=\"no\" class=\"symbolic\" "
"alt=\"Herunterfahren-Symbol\"]] auswählen, um den Computer herunterzufahren "
"oder"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
msgid "Select **Power Off**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
msgid ""
"If an application needs to be closed or an open document needs to be saved "
"before shutting down, a **Power Off** dialog appears with some details."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "[[!img desktop/system-with-wifi-only.png class=\"screenshot\" alt=\"\"]]\n"
msgid "   [[!img power_off_with_inhibitor.png class=\"screenshot\" alt=\"\"]]\n"
msgstr "[[!img desktop/system-with-wifi-only.png class=\"screenshot\" alt=\"\"]]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   Select the **Power Off** button to confirm.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   Else, the computer shuts down immediately.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<h2 id=\"emergency\">Emergency shutdown</h2>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
msgid ""
"To trigger an emergency shutdown, unplug the USB stick or eject the DVD from "
"which Tails is running. Doing so might be faster than shutting down from the "
"system menu."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<div class=\"caution\">\n"
msgstr "<div class=\"caution\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<p>You risk breaking your Persistent Storage and losing data when you unplug\n"
"your USB stick while Tails is running.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<p>If you use a Persistent Storage, only unplug your Tails USB stick in an\n"
"emergency.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</div>\n"
msgstr "</div>\n"

